      "review_summary": "The branch changes Feishu resource tool account selection to pass `ctx.sessionKey`, prefer runtime/configured Feishu bindings, move tool-family fallback before `defaultAccount`, and add focused routing tests plus generated baseline/lint updates.\n\nPR surface: Source +130, Tests +120, Generated 0. Total +250 across 10 files.\n\nReproducibility: yes. at source level: current main can return `channels.feishu.defaultAccount` before any binding-aware or required-tool family selection when `ctx.agentAccountId` is absent. The PR discussion also includes redacted live Feishu before/after proof for the bound-account path.",
