      "target": {
        "kind": "pull_request",
        "title": "fix(feishu): tool calls use bound account outside inbound messages",
        "body": "﻿Closes #96657\n\n## What Problem This Solves\n\nFeishu resource tools could run outside inbound Feishu messages without `ctx.agentAccountId`. In multi-account setups, that let wiki, drive, permission, bitable, doc, and app-scope tool calls fall back to global `channels.feishu.defaultAccount` instead of the Feishu account bound to the active session or agent.\n\nThat can route a tool call through the wrong Feishu app/tenant and surface as permission failures such as Feishu `99991672` or HTTP 403.\n\n## Change\n\nThe resolver now keeps explicit/contextual accounts first, then checks Feishu bindings before the global default:\n\n1. explicit tool `accountId`\n2. valid `ctx.agentAccountId`\n3. unique runtime Feishu account bound to `ctx.sessionKey`\n4. unique configured Feishu `bindings[]` account for the current agent\n5. first enabled account that supports the requested Feishu tool family\n6. `channels.feishu.defaultAccount`\n\nAmbiguous runtime or configured Feishu bindings fail closed instead of silently choosing `defaultAccount`.\n\nThis stays inside the Feishu extension and no longer adds a private routing SDK subpath.\n\n## Evidence\n\nRedacted live multi-account proof was run with default account `a` and bound account `b`: before the fix the same non-inbound Feishu resource call used `a` and failed; after the fix it used `b` and succeeded.\n\nFocused tests cover runtime binding, configured binding, ambiguity, contextual account precedence, and capability fallback before default.\n\n## Validation\n\n- `node scripts/run-vitest.mjs extensions/feishu/src/tool-account-routing.test.ts extensions/feishu/src/docx.account-selection.test.ts extensions/feishu/src/tool-account.test.ts` - passed, 36 tests\n- `node scripts/run-vitest.mjs src/plugins/contracts/extension-package-project-boundaries.test.ts -- -t \"xai|package boundary map\"` - passed\n- `node --max-old-space-size=8192 scripts/plugin-sdk-surface-report.mjs --check` - passed; public SDK remains 322 entrypoints / 10405 exports / 5223 callable exports\n- `node --max-old-space-size=8192 --import tsx scripts/generate-plugin-sdk-api-baseline.ts --check` - passed\n- `git diff --check` - passed\n\nFull extension package compile was started and passed Feishu, then stopped later on the pre-existing unrelated `qa-lab` `providerUrl/providerHeaders` type errors.\n\n## Scope\n\nThis PR covers Feishu resource tools only. `feishu_chat` remains separate.\n\nAI辅助：是，使用Codex GPT-5.5 xhigh审校辅助功能准备。\r\n",
